  "notes": "{訓練|くんれん} refers to systematic skill development.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {訓練|くんれん}する (to train)\n- {訓練|くんれん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}ける→受ける：01215_ukeru⟧ (to receive training)\n- {訓練|くんれん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{積|つ}む→積む：02294_tsumu⟧ (to accumulate training)\n\nTYPES OF TRAINING:\n- ⟦{避難|ひなん}→避難：07908_hinan⟧{訓練|くんれん} (evacuation drill)\n- ⟦{防災|ぼうさい}→防災：07907_bousai⟧{訓練|くんれん} (disaster drill)\n- ⟦{軍事|ぐんじ}→軍事：14392_gunji⟧{訓練|くんれん} (military training)\n- ⟦{職業|しょくぎょう}→職業：03245_shokugyou⟧{訓練|くんれん} (vocational training)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {訓練|くんれん}: training (formal, systematic)\n- ⟦{練習|れんしゅう}→練習：05323_renshuu⟧: practice (general, skill development)\n- ⟦{研修|けんしゅう}→研修：05322_kenshuu⟧: training seminar (professional development)",
